WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.030
- I am like 99% sure

00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:04.330
that there is some sort of

00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:07.040
infectious disease in this kitchen.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.210
(upbeat acoustic music)

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:11.660
Hey everybody, my name's Ashley

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:15.270
and today I have a little bit
of an unusual video for you,

00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:17.670
it is a clean with me video.

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:19.100
Maybe you've heard of
them, maybe you haven't.

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:21.140
I just discovered them recently

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:22.460
and I am totally hooked.

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:25.920
They are basically vlogs of
people cleaning their houses.

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:27.050
I know what you're thinking,

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:30.120
hmm, that sounds more boring
than actually cleaning.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:32.840
But I promise for some reason it is not.

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:34.080
They are totally mesmerizing.

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:35.180
I am completely hooked.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:36.300
I can't stop watching.

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:39.300
Now, all I wanna do is clean my apartment.

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.020
I'm gonna take you guys
along for the ride.

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:42.830
I hope you enjoy, I hope it inspires you

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:44.850
to maybe clean one of your own spaces

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:47.440
and yeah, I got a lot of work to do,

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:49.022
so let's go get scrubbing.

00:00:49.022 --> 00:00:52.355
(upbeat acoustic music)

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:14.960
This is why I'm emptying
the entire kitchen first,

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:16.810
things like this soap scum and stuff,

00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:18.300
I would have never even noticed

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:20.850
if I hadn't removed the soap container,

00:01:20.850 --> 00:01:23.080
the dish rack, and all those things.

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:25.470
You just don't realize the scum and stuff

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:27.241
that is building up in your life.

00:01:27.241 --> 00:01:32.241
(bell chiming)
(upbeat acoustic music)

00:01:39.010 --> 00:01:40.850
The kitchen is empty,
it's looking pretty good

00:01:40.850 --> 00:01:43.470
and now it is time for admittedly

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:45.290
my least favorite part of this whole thing

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:48.550
and that is scrubbing and sanitizing.

00:01:48.550 --> 00:01:52.050
(mellow electronic music)

00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:02.002
(electronic beeping)

00:02:02.002 --> 00:02:05.752
Okay, let's see if that
worked, I don't know.

00:02:06.718 --> 00:02:07.833
(gasps)

00:02:07.833 --> 00:02:10.833
Whoa, okay, this hack is a good one.

00:02:11.873 --> 00:02:15.373
(mellow electronic music)

00:03:32.129 --> 00:03:35.462
(upbeat acoustic music)

00:04:29.862 --> 00:04:31.030
(bells chiming)

00:04:31.030 --> 00:04:33.570
It is time to start my
all-time favorite part

00:04:33.570 --> 00:04:35.807
of any deep clean, organizing.

00:04:35.807 --> 00:04:36.692
(bells chiming)

00:04:36.692 --> 00:04:40.109
(upbeat soft rock music)

00:04:59.921 --> 00:05:01.610
(bells chiming)

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:04.943
(upbeat acoustic music)

00:05:20.705 --> 00:05:23.038
(squeaking)

